(** The site: its pages, as HTML. The s-expression language is the rules
    of pages/ (pages/pages.lang); main.soma is not under pages/, so it does
    not have [sexp], and imports JSX for [render]. See README.md. *)
Import JSX.
Import pages.home.
Import pages.counter.

("<!DOCTYPE html>" ++ render home)%str.
render (view 3).
